OL,3,GNEWSA'Domestic violence changes who you
OL,4,Aare, but there is hope'
OL,5,
OL,6,FLianne and Rebecca are in fits of
OL,7,Fgiggles as they compare their paintings
OL,8,Fto the one they are copying, created by
OL,9,Fthe artist leading their sip and paint
OL,10,Fevent.
OL,12,FFrom the outside they look like any
OL,13,Fnormal group of friends. But as little
OL,14,Fas six months ago, some of these women
OL,15,Fwere in situations they felt they might
OL,16,Fnever escape.
OL,18,FEveryone at this event shares a lived
OL,19,Fexperience of domestic violence.
OL,23,APub: 28-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
